{
    "chapter_num": 4,
    "verses_count": 34,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Solomon’s Administration"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So King Solomon was king over all Israel. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And these "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " his officials: Azariah the son of Zadok, the priest; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Elihoreph and Ahijah, the sons of Shisha, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "secretaries"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "scribes; Jehoshaphat the son of Ahilud, the recorder; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Benaiah the son of Jehoiada, over the army; Zadok and Abiathar, the priests; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Azariah the son of Nathan, over the officers; Zabud the son of Nathan, a priest "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the king’s friend; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ahishar, over the household; and Adoniram the son of Abda, over the labor force."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Solomon had twelve governors over all Israel, who provided food for the king and his household; each one made provision for one month of the year. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "These "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " their names: "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Son of Hur"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ben-Hur, in the mountains of Ephraim; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Son of Deker"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ben-Deker, in Makaz, Shaalbim, Beth Shemesh, and Elon Beth Hanan; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Son of Hesed"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ben-Hesed, in Arubboth; to him "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "belonged"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Sochoh and all the land of Hepher; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Son of Abinadab"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ben-Abinadab, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " all the regions of Dor; he had Taphath the daughter of Solomon as wife; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Baana the son of Ahilud, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Taanach, Megiddo, and all Beth Shean, which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " beside Zaretan below Jezreel, from Beth Shean to Abel Meholah, as far as the other side of Jokneam; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Son of Geber"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ben-Geber, in Ramoth Gilead; to him "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "belonged"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the towns of Jair the son of Manasseh, in Gilead; to him "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "also belonged"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the region of Argob in Bashan—sixty large cities with walls and bronze gate-bars; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ahinadab the son of Iddo, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Mahanaim; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ahimaaz, in Naphtali; he also took Basemath the daughter of Solomon as wife; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Baanah the son of Hushai, in Asher and Aloth; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Jehoshaphat the son of Paruah, in Issachar; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Shimei the son of Elah, in Benjamin; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Geber the son of Uri, in the land of Gilead, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the country of Sihon king of the Amorites, and of Og king of Bashan. "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "He was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the only governor who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the land."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Prosperity and Wisdom of Solomon’s Reign"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Judah and Israel "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " as numerous as the sand by the sea in multitude, eating and drinking and rejoicing. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Solomon reigned over all kingdoms from the"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "The Euphrates"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " River "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "to"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the land of the Philistines, as far as the border of Egypt. "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "They"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " brought tribute and served Solomon all the days of his life."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now Solomon’s "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. bread"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "provision for one day was thirty "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Each about 5 bushels"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "kors of fine flour, sixty kors of meal, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "ten fatted oxen, twenty oxen from the pastures, and one hundred sheep, besides deer, gazelles, roebucks, and fatted fowl."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For he had dominion over all "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the region"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on this side of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "The Euphrates"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the River from Tiphsah even to Gaza, namely over all the kings on this side of the River; and he had peace on every side all around him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Judah and Israel dwelt"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "lived in safety"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " safely, each man under his vine and his fig tree, from Dan as far as Beersheba, all the days of Solomon."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Solomon had "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "So with MT, most other authorities; some LXX mss. four thousand; cf. 2 Chr. 9:25"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "forty thousand stalls of horses for his chariots, and twelve thousand horsemen. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And these governors, each man in his month, provided food for King Solomon and for all who came to King Solomon’s table. There was no lack in their supply. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "They also brought barley and straw to the proper place, for the horses and steeds, each man according to his charge."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And God gave Solomon wisdom and exceedingly great understanding, and largeness of heart like the sand on the seashore. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Thus Solomon’s wisdom excelled the wisdom of all the men of the East and all the wisdom of Egypt. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For he was wiser than all men—than Ethan the Ezrahite, and Heman, Chalcol, and Darda, the sons of Mahol; and his fame was in all the surrounding nations. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He spoke three thousand proverbs, and his songs were one thousand and five. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Also he spoke of trees, from the cedar tree of Lebanon even to the hyssop that springs out of the wall; he spoke also of animals, of birds, of creeping things, and of fish. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 34,
                    "num_str": "34",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And men of all nations, from all the kings of the earth who had heard of his wisdom, came to hear the wisdom of Solomon."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}